RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY;BYMONTH=10;BYMONTHDAY=1
SUMMARY:NZ general sports fish season (rivers & streams)
DESCRIPTION:Main trout season for most NZ rivers and streams. Some waters s
 tay open all year and regional rules vary - check Fish & Game.
CATEGORIES:Fly Fishing,New Zealand,National
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
