BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nz-winter-fishery@nz-fly-fishing-seasons
DTSTAMP:20260519T000000Z
SEQUENCE:0
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270501
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270701
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY;BYMONTH=5;BYMONTHDAY=1
SUMMARY:North Island winter fishing (designated waters)
DESCRIPTION:Some designated North Island rivers (parts of the Eastern and A
 uckland/Waikato regions) stay open for winter fishing past the general 30 
 April close\, until 30 June.
CATEGORIES:Fly Fishing,New Zealand,Winter Fishery
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
