SEQUENCE:0
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261201
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270601
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY;BYMONTH=12;BYMONTHDAY=1
SUMMARY:Taupō District river season (above winter limits)
DESCRIPTION:Taupō District season for rivers and streams above the winter-
